  "description": "Journey across breathtaking destinations and stunning landscapes in Jigsaw Puzzle: Around the World, a relaxing jigsaw experience spanning the most spectacular places on Earth. Explore snow-capped mountain ranges, wander through sun-soaked city boulevards, and discover awe-inspiring worlds unlike any other!\nThe game features 30 handcrafted levels, each depicting a unique location filled with rich detail and atmosphere. Play using touch controls or controllers! With the built-in saving system, you can stop whenever you want and continue later without losing progress.\nDesigned for both short sessions and extended play, Jigsaw Puzzle: Around the World is perfect for relaxing on the go or unwinding at home.\n\nFeatures:\n› 30 handcrafted jigsaw levels spanning extraordinary destinations across the globe\n› Diverse, richly illustrated artwork — from the golden forests of a mountain wilderness to the vibrant streets of a coastal city\n› Touch controls and controller support, switch anytime\n› Save and resume freely whenever you want\n› A calm, immersive experience for all ages",
